### How to use this in your website (JavaScript Example):
If you host this file, you can fetch it and display the images like this:

```javascript
fetch('imageData.json')
  .then(response => response.json())
  .then(data => {
    data.forEach(image => {
      console.log(`Loading image: ${image.title}`);
      const imgElement = document.createElement('img');
      imgElement.src = image.url;
      imgElement.alt = image.alt;
      document.body.appendChild(imgElement);
    });
  });
```